ow of neat and white teeth. The eyes narrow into curved crescents, with obvious crow's feet squeezed out at the corners. Both hands are raised high in the air, clapping merrily, making a clear and loud sound, and the body sways slightly with the laughter.\nCrying: The brows are furrowed in an \"eight\" shape. The eyes are filled with tears, and the eye sockets are red. Big teardrops roll down the cheeks. Both hands are folded over the mouth, trying to suppress the sobs.\nanger: The eyes are wide open, glaring furiously. The eyes seem to be spitting fire. The eyebrows are raised in an inverted \"eight\" shape. The teeth are grinding loudly, and the cheeks puff up due to the force. Both hands clench into fists, the arm muscles are tense, and they are raised high, as if ready to smash at the thing that makes him angry at any time.\nGaping: The mouth opens wide in an \"O\" shape, revealing some teeth and the tongue. The eyes are rounded, as if about to pop out of the eye sockets. One hand covers the wide - open mouth, and the other hand stretches straight, pointing at the surprising thing. The body leans forward, and the center of gravity is unstable.\nPuzzled: The brows are slightly furrowed, with a shallow \"Sichuan\" character pattern appearing between the eyebrows. The eyes are slightly narrowed in confusion, and the eyes reveal a sense of bewilderment. One hand supports the chin, and the index finger and thumb gently rub the chin, as if thinking about a difficult problem, and the head tilts slightly.\nShy: The cheeks turn red, spreading from the cheeks to the ears. The eyes dodge, not daring to look directly at others. The fingers of both hands are interlaced and keep fiddling with each other. Occasionally, the hand gently strokes the hair by the ear, and the body turns slightly to the side, trying to cover up one's shyness.\nNaughty: The eyes blink playfully, with one eye closed and the other half - open. The corners of the mouth rise, revealing a cunning smile. One hand is placed beside the cheek, the index finger is extended, pulling the cheek flesh outwards to make a face, and the other hand makes various funny poses in front of the body.\nenjoyment: The eyes are slightly closed, with a contented smile on the face. The corners of the mouth rise slightly, and the expression is relaxed. Both hands are in a semi - clenched fist shape, placed in front of the chest, moving up and down slowly, as if feeling something wonderful, and the body sways gently along with it.\nTerrified: The mouth opens wide, making a silent scream. The eyes are extremely wide open, full of fear, and the pupils contract. Both hands tightly hold the head, the body trembles, as if ready to flee at any time.\nanxious: The brows are tightly furrowed into a deep \"Sichuan\" character, and the eyes are moving restlessly and quickly, looking around. Both hands keep rubbing against each other, as if this can relieve the inner anxiety. Occasionally, the person raises a hand to check the watch, and the feet are constantly moving in a small range.\nterrified: The eyes are extremely wide open, full of fear, and the pupils contract sharply. Both hands quickly rise and tightly cover the mouth, as if trying to prevent a scream from bursting out. The body is also shaking uncontrollably, and the feet unconsciously step backward.\nshy: The cheeks turn red instantly, and the eyes dart around nervously, not daring to meet others' eyes. One hand scratches the back of the head awkwardly, with the fingers stirring uneasily in the hair. The other hand tugs nervously at the corner of the clothes, and the body twists slightly.\nlethargic: The eyelids droop heavily, with the eyes half - open and blurred. One hand rises and slowly rubs the eyes, with a slow and weak movement. The other hand is casually placed on the back of the sofa, and the body is lazily slumped in the sofa.", 0, 9999, ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptLine", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "siz